    {
      "turn": 4,
      "doctor_question": "How long have you been experiencing these thoughts about patterns and hearing this voice?",
      "targeted_symptom": "psychotic_symptoms_duration",
      "patient_response": "I guess... well, the voices and that feeling that the numbers are actually messages, that's been happening for about eight months now. It started right around the time the weather started getting cold. Which reminds me, I really need to buy a new winter coat. My old one, this heavy wool peacoat I got at a thrift store, it has a hole in the left pocket. I kept losing my keys in the lining, and one time they slid all the way down to the hem, and I had to cut a slit in the bottom just to get them out. The thrift store where I bought it is actually closing down next month, which is a real shame because they always had the best selection of vintage vinyl records. I found an original pressing of a Fleetwood Mac album there once for like two dollars... but yeah, about eight months.",
